    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're supposed to say that, but it's just words. it doesn't change the fact that i've ruined everything. the shame is so heavy i can't even look at them. it feels like a permanent stain on the family. honestly, it feels like the only way to actually protect them and stop the cycle is just to stop existing. it feels like the only logical way to settle the score.",
